<https://w3id.org/tern/ontologies/org/Role> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Represents additional information about a relationship or property. For example a Role can be used to say that a 'member' role linking some SportsTeam to a player occurred during a particular time period. Or that a Person's 'actor' role in a Movie was for some particular characterName. Such properties can be attached to a Role entity, which is then associated with the main entities using ordinary properties like 'member' or 'actor'.\\n\\nSee also [blog post](http://blog.schema.org/2014/06/introducing-role.html)." .
